{"content":[{"id":"6d5129fb","settings":{"margin":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":false},"padding":{"unit":"px","top":"50","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":false},"margin_mobile":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":false},"padding_mobile":{"unit":"px","top":"30","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":false}},"elements":[{"id":"30a419e4","settings":{"html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html lang=\"pt-br\">\r\n<head>\r\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\r\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\r\n    <title>Pr\u00e9-venda<\/title>\r\n    <style>\r\n        \/* Definindo o estilo para a p\u00e1gina *\/\r\n        body, html {\r\n            margin: 0;\r\n            padding: 0;\r\n            height: 100%;\r\n            display: flex;\r\n            justify-content: center;\r\n            align-items: center;\r\n            background-image: url('COLE O LINK DA FOTO AQUI');\r\n            background-size: cover;\r\n            background-position: center;\r\n            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        \/* Container do bot\u00e3o *\/\r\n        .button-container {\r\n            display: flex;\r\n            justify-content: center;\r\n            align-items: center;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        \/* Estilo do bot\u00e3o *\/\r\n        .cta-button {\r\n            background-color: #FF007F; \/* Cor rosa *\/\r\n            color: white;\r\n            font-size: 20px;\r\n            padding: 15px 30px;\r\n            border: none;\r\n            border-radius: 8px;\r\n            cursor: pointer;\r\n            text-align: center;\r\n            transition: background-color 0.3s ease;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .cta-button:hover {\r\n            background-color: #FF3385; \/* Efeito de hover *\/\r\n        }\r\n    <\/style>\r\n<\/head>\r\n<body>\r\n\r\n    <!-- Cont\u00eainer para o bot\u00e3o -->\r\n    <div class=\"button-container\">\r\n        <!-- Bot\u00e3o que direciona apenas para o segundo link -->\r\n        <button class=\"cta-button\" onclick=\"redirecionar()\">Clique aqui para saber mais<\/button>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <script type=\"text\/javascript\">\r\n        \/\/ Fun\u00e7\u00e3o que redireciona exclusivamente para o segundo link\r\n        function redirecionar() {\r\n            window.location.href = \"COLE O LINK DO WHATSAPP AQUI\";\r\n        }\r\n    <\/script>\r\n\r\n<\/body>\r\n<\/html>\r\n"},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"html","elType":"widget"}],"isInner":false,"elType":"container"}],"page_settings":[],"version":"0.4","title":"PRESELL ATUALIZADA","type":"page"}